# Allowlist: send Docker only what the image build needs. Everything else,
# including any new file someone adds later (secrets, local data), stays out by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src
# Only each workspace member's pyproject.toml: uv checks that every member in
# uv.lock exists, but the image installs none of them.
!packages
packages/**
!packages/*/pyproject.toml

# Drop local bytecode caches from src/ so they don't change the COPY layer.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[oc]
